---
description: Change control for the hash-chained audit log
globs: packages/audit/**
---
This package is the evidence surface. Rules:
- Append-only. No UPDATE/DELETE path, no "repair" helper that rewrites hashes.
- `hash = sha256(prev_hash ‖ canonical_json(row without hash))`. Canonical JSON is byte-stable.
- Event types are the closed enum in packages/shared. Unknown event → fail closed, do not log a silent skip.
- `pnpm audit:verify` must report the first break seq. Tests: RT-10 (edit one SQLite row).
- No I/O besides the log store passed in. No LLM. No Date.now() inside hash computation; `ts` is an argument.
- Second-opinion review required before merge, same as packages/policy.
